      "text": "A line chart of doses administered by month, January to December, comparing a dashed orange \"Target\" line, rising steadily from about 200 to about 2650, with a solid blue line for DPT-HepB-Hib 3 doses, rising from about 150 to about 1850. The gap between the doses given and the target widens through the year. The series label is cut off at the right edge of the image.",
